# NOTE: third-party/compiled/ (the per-filetype `.yrc` + manifest.json) is
# deliberately COMMITTED, not ignored. A published traits bundle is a plain
# `git archive` of this repo, so precompiled rules only reach clients if they
# live in git. They are byte-reproducible from the rule sources, and git deltas
# successive versions to well under a KiB per rule change. Regenerate with
# `make yara-compile` (and verify with `make yara-verify`) whenever a `.yar`,
# `.yara`, or inline-YARA trait YAML changes.
samples/
